Short:        Filters pre-processed C source
Author:       aniere@massena.univ-mlv.fr
Uploader:     aniere massena univ-mlv fr
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos


This program removes all empty lines on a C source which has been
pre-processed.
It needs Ixemul.library to work.
